{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 1. Overall Experience\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Hi, I\u8217'm Sahil Pawar. After exploring the website, I think it makes tractor research more convenient for buyers.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 2. Issues and Suggestions\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 One problem I noticed is that finding a specific tractor in a long list can take time. Adding better search and filtering options, such as brand and horsepower, would help users find relevant models faster.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 3. Positive Aspects\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 My favourite feature is the side-by-side tractor comparison. It allows users to evaluate specifications together instead of remembering details from different pages.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 I also liked the clean presentation of information, which makes browsing more comfortable.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 4. Overall Feedback\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Overall, the website has useful features, and improving model search would make it easier to use.\par}
